    <name>SERVICES Big Sur Village (last real resupply)</name>
    <desc>The River Inn / Ripplewood / Fernwood cluster, with a general store and delis over about 1 km of Highway 1. THE last dense resupply before a very thin 90 km. Fill everything here. Hours are seasonal and early-closing - VERIFY on the day.  [day1_sf_limekiln km 252]</desc>
    <sym>Convenience Store</sym>
