    <name>Pfeiffer Big Sur SP - short-day fallback</name>
    <desc>In Big Sur Village, ~41 km SHORT of Limekiln (day 1 becomes 256 km - see pch_day1_alt_pfeiffer.gpx). The fallback if the light goes or the legs do. Full facilities, water, showers, and stores within walking distance. Also the sane place to stop rather than descend the Big Sur cliffs after dark.  [day1_sf_limekiln km 255]</desc>
