  <wpt lat="35.989160" lon="-121.495570">
    <ele>58.0</ele>
    <name>Kirk Creek Campground (USFS) - fallback</name>
    <desc>3.5 km SOUTH of Limekiln, on the ocean bluff where Nacimiento-Fergusson Road meets Highway 1. USFS Los Padres, recreation.gov. The obvious fallback if Limekiln has no bed. VERIFY hiker/biker availability and whether any sites are held back for walk-ups - USFS policy differs from State Parks. No potable water historically; carry what you need.  [day2_limekiln_refugio km 3]</desc>
    <sym>Campground</sym>
