    <desc>Third of the three Gaviota-coast hike/bike parks, 2.6 km east of Refugio, and the one with the most services. Reported first-come, first-served on the middle/upper loops through 28 Jun 2026 - VERIFY current status and whether that extends to August.  [day2_limekiln_refugio km 280]</desc>
    <sym>Campground</sym>
    <type>camp</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.461000" lon="-120.036000">
    <ele>11.0</ele>
    <name>INFO Aniso Trail - paved path El Capitan &lt;-&gt; Refugio</name>
    <desc>A 2.5 mile undulating paved bike path along the bluff between El Capitan and Refugio - the pleasant way to start day 3 instead of the 101 shoulder. A segment has been closed for storm damage; VERIFY on site, and drop back onto 101 if it is shut.  [day2_limekiln_refugio km 280]</desc>
    <sym>Bike Trail</sym>
